  <prompt>Add the read-only MCP tool spaarke_get_matter_finance over FinanceSummaryService.GetSummaryAsync for one matter, authorised by task 008's shared method (step 0 RequireInternalFinanceCaller plus finance.read on the matter), so a caller the REST route GET /api/finance/matters/{matterId}/summary refuses is refused with the same reasonCode. No invoice review or approval.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in Spaarke finance authorization and MCP tool handlers.</role>
  <goal>The tool returns the REST summary (slimmed) for an allowed caller and the same refusal reasonCode for every caller REST refuses.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-11; EB-D-194 (no invoice review/approval in Copilot). REST: Api/Finance/FinanceEndpoints.cs (GET /matters/{matterId:guid}/summary :96); service Services/Finance/FinanceSummaryService.cs (GetSummaryAsync :140). Task 008 added the shared method on FinanceAuthorizationFilter (for example AuthorizeMatterFinanceReadAsync). ebilling-r1 reviews.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Finance/GetMatterFinanceTool.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.Finance.cs</file>
      <file role="new">tests/integration/auth/Mcp/Finance/GetMatterFinanceToolAuthTests.cs (each REST refusal mirrored)</file>
      <file role="new">tests/integration/contract/Api/Mcp/Finance/GetMatterFinanceToolContractTests.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Filters/FinanceAuthorizationFilter.cs (after 008)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">tests/integration/contract/Api/Finance/FinanceEndpointsAuthorizationContractTests.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">tests/integration/auth/Finance/MatterFinanceReadSharedMethodTests.cs (task 008)</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="008" status="pending">Shared finance read authorization</dependency>
      <dependency task="020" status="pending">General McpToolResults, ledger partials</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">r1 gate RELEASED 2026-11-25 (joint mcp-r1/mcp-r2 determination under the owner's delegation; see notes/decisions.md D-r1-gate). Before starting, merge origin/master into this branch (merge, never rebase). Do not edit r1's ISS-010 files (DecisionCommitService, Actions/DecisionActionExecutors, RecordCreationService, CallerWriteAuthorization, CallerRecordAccessProbe, CallerMetadataReadMemo, AssignTaskNotifier, the email-bell job handler) or the Decision wizard heading files (DecisionWizard/steps/FoundStep.tsx, Worklist/IssueLine.tsx, composeIssueLine.ts) without messaging mcp-r1 first.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Run as the caller (IHttpContextAccessor; UserContextRequired; no app-only fallback). Authorization is exactly 008's method; the tool adds no check and maps its refusal with the REST reasonCode.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">MUST NOT expose invoice review, approval, rejection or invoice search (EB-D-194): this task adds one read tool only. readOnlyHint true, destructiveHint false, idempotentHint true; description ≤ 1,024 characters ("budget, spend and accruals for one matter; not invoice approval"). Ledger row in RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.Finance.cs.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-015">Model-visible: totals and period figures only; no line-item narrative or secured fields. Logs: tool name, latency, outcome/reasonCode, correlation id.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-029">Every change this task makes under src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ is listed in the PR with a Placement Justification that cites .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md (source: spec.md 'Placement &amp; New Components'), and the PR records the publish-size delta against a fresh master build per .claude/constraints/azure-deployment.md 'BFF Publish-Size Per-Task Verification Rule': +5 MB or more needs explicit justification, 55 MB total triggers architecture review, 60 MB is a hard stop. No new HIGH CVE (dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Every test this task adds lives on a KEEP path (tests/integration/{auth,contract,regression,data-mutation}/** or tests/unit/domain/**), mocks only at module boundaries, and uses no Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt; or Mock&lt;IServiceClient&gt;.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Before each push run bash scripts/quality/check-changed-cs-format.sh origin/master. CS0618 is a build error: migrate, never suppress.</constraint>
  </constraints>

