  <justification>
    <existing>FinanceSummaryService.GetSummaryAsync behind GET /api/finance/matters/{id}/summary; 008's shared method; notes/reuse-scan.md row "Matter finance".</existing>
    <extension>Both are reused; the tool is a thin adapter.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Copilot users cannot ask for a matter's finance position (FR-11 fails).</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

