  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">For an allowed caller the tool's figures equal the REST summary.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: for each caller the REST route refuses (external caller, no finance.read on the matter, missing matter), the tool returns isError with the same reasonCode and calls no finance service.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: no tool in Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Finance/ references invoice review, confirm or reject (grep in the test).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">ArchTests and conformance pass; publish-size delta recorded; no new HIGH CVE.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test scope: cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named in these criteria; anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in the task notes.</criterion>
